{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55241","headline":"题案上诗（题拟） · 任赞","name":"题案上诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数年叨内署，衫色俨然倾。\n任赞字希度，知君是火精。\n（见《类说》卷五四《玉堂闲话》。\n）（〖1〗《玉堂闲话》：「梁朝翰林学士任赞居职数年，犹着朱绂，於案上题诗。\n梁主知之，命赐紫袍金章。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}